# NOTE: .mvn/ is intentionally NOT ignored — every Maven service commits its
# .mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.properties (wrapper "only-script" mode needs it to
# know which Maven to download; without it ./mvnw fails on a fresh checkout).
# Only the downloaded wrapper jar would be ignorable, and none is committed.

